  "content": {
    "markdown": "**V0.1.4** of *[Stormworks: Build and Rescue](https://stormworks.fandom.com/wiki/Stormworks:_Build_and_Rescue)* was released on March 1, 2018.\n\n## V0.1.4\n\n- Fix - nuclear island and other island physics now works correctly\n- Fix - can no longer walk through some doors\n- Fix - camera no longer clips though objects\n- Fix - removed help popups from game\n- Fix - mission condition where vehicle despawning no longer causes crash\n\n## Source\n\n- [Steam Community News](https://steamcommunity.com/gid/103582791458364316/announcements/detail/1652130539540834359)",
    "plain_text": "V0.1.4\n of\nStormworks: Build and Rescue\n was released on March 1, 2018.\n\nV0.1.4\n\nFix - nuclear island and other island physics now works correctly\n\nFix - can no longer walk through some doors\n\nFix - camera no longer clips though objects\n\nFix - removed help popups from game\n\nFix - mission condition where vehicle despawning no longer causes crash\n\nSource\n\nSteam Community News",
    "char_count": 555,
    "word_count": 62,
    "sha256": "01de278220aade8f4760346d6a40e1341cb78aef499eba3ae722215883861d60"
  },
  "wikitext": "'''{{PAGENAME}}''' of ''[[Stormworks: Build and Rescue]]'' was released on March 1, 2018.\n\n=={{PAGENAME}}==\n*Fix - nuclear island and other island physics now works correctly\n*Fix - can no longer walk through some doors\n*Fix - camera no longer clips though objects\n*Fix - removed help popups from game\n*Fix - mission condition where vehicle despawning no longer causes crash \n\n==Source==\n* [https://steamcommunity.com/gid/103582791458364316/announcements/detail/1652130539540834359 Steam Community News]\n{{Patch note nav|2018}}\n[[Category:Patch notes]]",
